`s146 the witness says the contract was in a document` MEANS `Matters in Writing Facts` WITH
    `the witness says that a contract, grant or other disposition of property as to which the witness is giving evidence was contained in a document` IS TRUE
    `the witness is about to make a statement as to the contents of a document which in the opinion of the court ought to be produced` IS FALSE
    `the evidence is of statements made by other persons about the contents of documents, and the statements are in themselves relevant facts` IS FALSE
    `the document has been produced, or facts have been proved which entitle the party who called the witness to give secondary evidence of it` IS FALSE

